            "text": "{\"title\":\"Make-Ahead Overnight Kimchi Jjigae with Tender Pork Shoulder\",\"readyInMinutes\":780,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"This \u003cb\u003eovernight Korean kimchi and pork shoulder stew\u003c/b\u003e is specifically crafted to be made ahead, allowing the intense fermented spice and rich pork fat to harmonize into a profoundly comforting soup. By chilling the base stew for at least twelve hours before reheating, the \u003cb\u003eaged cabbage kimchi\u003c/b\u003e softens further and absorbs the savory garlic, ginger, and red pepper notes deeply into its fibers. Upon reheating, soft tofu and earthy shiitake mushrooms are gently folded in, adding fresh textures that contrast beautifully with the melded broth. Perfect for meal preparation or stress-free entertaining, this traditional dish actually tastes significantly better on the second day as the spicy gochujang broth thickens naturally in the refrigerator. Served alongside warm rice and assorted banchan side dishes, this hearty stew brings authentic restaurant-quality depth straight to your dinner table with minimal effortless finishing steps on serving day. Enjoy a deeply satisfying bowl that delivers bold, tangy, and rich umbrella of flavors in every single spoonful.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":420.0,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":21.0},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":24.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":37.7},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":7.2,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":36.0},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":18.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":6.0},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":5.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":6.1},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":32.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":64.0},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":75.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":25.0},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":1180.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":51.3},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"am